{"id":"n16006-1-7","stage":3,"title":"안부 · 问候","scene":"社会与交往","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n16006-1-7-1","ko":"어머니, 승규는 잘 지내고 있나요?","zh":"伯母，承奎过得好吗？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"어머니,","meaning":"妈，大妈","explanation":"어머니：妈，大妈","readings":[{"term":"어머니","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"74361","senseId":"4","lemma":"어머니","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내고","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있나요?","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；나요：礼貌、委婉地询问。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"a8f7e3b1e379f488","term":"어머니","zh":"妈，大妈","audio":"/audio/a8f7e3b1e379f4880b79.mp3","entryId":"74361","definition":"用于亲切地指称或称呼与自己母亲年龄相仿的女子。","pronunciation":["어머니"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]}],"audio":"/audio/12caee423ba5d75778e5.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n16006-1-7-2","ko":"그래. 승규는 잘 지내고 있어. 승규한테도 네 안부를 잘 전해 줄게.","zh":"嗯，他过得很好。我也会把你的问候转达给承奎的。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"그래.","meaning":"好吧，是","explanation":"그래：好吧，是","readings":[{"term":"그래","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27656","senseId":"1","lemma":"그래","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규는","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"승규는","audio":"/audio/8cca37774e5e7081db86.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"好好地，顺利地","explanation":"잘：好好地，顺利地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"지내고","meaning":"度日，生活","explanation":"지내다：度日，生活；고：连接并列或先后的动作、状态；也用于 -고 있다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"지내다","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"17173","senseId":"1","lemma":"지내다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"있어.","meaning":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","explanation":"있다：正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）；어：非敬语句末；与熟悉的人或晚辈交谈，语调决定陈述、询问等语气。","readings":[{"term":"있다","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62595","senseId":"2","lemma":"있다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"승규한테도","meaning":"承奎","explanation":"승규：承奎；한테：口语格助词，表示动作所涉及的人：“给、对、向”等。；도：表示“也、连……也”。","readings":[{"term":"승규한테도","audio":"/audio/521ce20323c222054f08.mp3"}],"sources":[]},{"text":"네","meaning":"你","explanation":"너：你；의：所属、关联或修饰，常对应“的”。","readings":[{"term":"너","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"64390","senseId":"1","lemma":"너","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"안부를","meaning":"问候","explanation":"안부：问候；를：宾格助词，标记动作对象。","readings":[{"term":"안부","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16006","senseId":"1","lemma":"안부","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"잘","meaning":"亲切地，真诚地","explanation":"잘：亲切地，真诚地","readings":[{"term":"잘","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58939","senseId":"6","lemma":"잘","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"전해","meaning":"转达","explanation":"전하다：转达；어：连接后续动作或辅助表达；常与前面的词干缩合。","readings":[{"term":"전하다","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"75767","senseId":"4","lemma":"전하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]},{"text":"줄게.","meaning":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","explanation":"주다：为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）；ㄹ게：向对方表达说话人的决定或承诺，非敬语。","readings":[{"term":"주다","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"77245","senseId":"1","lemma":"주다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}]}],"words":[{"id":"d39087dda3899d88","term":"그래","zh":"好吧，是","audio":"/audio/d39087dda3899d88b99b.mp3","entryId":"27656","definition":"用于回答，表示“会那样做，是那样的，知道了”等肯定的含义。","pronunciation":["그래"]},{"id":"8aff11a4aebdccdb","term":"잘","zh":"好好地，顺利地；亲切地，真诚地","audio":"/audio/8aff11a4aebdccdbf05d.mp3","entryId":"58939","definition":"没有任何问题而舒服地。","pronunciation":["잘"]},{"id":"d56e2e0e23cd1763","term":"지내다","zh":"度日，生活","audio":"/audio/d56e2e0e23cd1763208c.mp3","entryId":"17173","definition":"以某种程度或状态过日子。","pronunciation":["지ː내다"]},{"id":"96fe52db2531c9e7","term":"있다","zh":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","audio":"/audio/96fe52db2531c9e73e53.mp3","entryId":"62595","definition":"正在做、持续进行（-고 있다）","pronunciation":["읻따"]},{"id":"734dae8e9d9a8f8b","term":"너","zh":"你","audio":"/audio/734dae8e9d9a8f8b763b.mp3","entryId":"64390","definition":"指代听者，用于朋友或晚辈。","pronunciation":["너"]},{"id":"5fd69abae96ae59b","term":"안부","zh":"问候","audio":"/audio/5fd69abae96ae59b4e30.mp3","entryId":"16006","definition":"某人是否过得平安的消息；或指转达或询问那个来打招呼。","pronunciation":["안부"]},{"id":"4adf4bd60c3c1626","term":"전하다","zh":"转达","audio":"/audio/4adf4bd60c3c16263914.mp3","entryId":"75767","definition":"将消息、想法等告知对方。","pronunciation":["전하다"]},{"id":"1b43f195318e9604","term":"주다","zh":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","audio":"/audio/1b43f195318e9604abd7.mp3","entryId":"77245","definition":"为别人做某事（-아/어 주다）","pronunciation":["주다"]}],"audio":"/audio/a59257c8239d9d39dd1a.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":3.058,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=16006","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":103,"sequenceScore":2.7114,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["嗯，他过得很好。我也会把你的问候转达给承奎的。","伯母，承奎过得好吗？","我不太明白那两者的区别啊。"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["伯母，承奎过得好吗？","我不太明白那两者的区别啊。","嗯，他过得很好。我也会把你的问候转达给承奎的。"],"answer":2}]}
